{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152710/extras/046eac1a9f68b972a8613a58a6b424df.avif?t=1760333569\" width=1212 height=178 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HOUSE OF HORROR: OUTSIDE IS BETTER&quot; thrusts players into a chilling first-person horror adventure, navigating a nightmarish torture facility overrun by psychiatric patients exhibiting dangerously violent behavior. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This immersive experience offers a terrifying blend of suspense, horror, and psychological dread, pushing the boundaries of survival in a place where escape seems impossible. Developed by veterans of the horror genre, this game challenges even the most hardened players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152710/extras/3740eb47e565aeedf82df7686eccdb8f.webp?t=1760333569\" width=74 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep within a secretive underground facility, unspeakable horrors unfold as psychiatric patients, driven to the edge of madness, become violent and uncontrollable. Once a place of human experimentation and torment, this twisted prison has now become the stage for survival as you, Subject 117, attempt to escape its dark corridors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152710/extras/fdff5fa428a04c128e4f9594cad5f64e.poster.avif?t=1760333569\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152710/extras/fdff5fa428a04c128e4f9594cad5f64e.webm?t=1760333569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152710/extras/fdff5fa428a04c128e4f9594cad5f64e.mp4?t=1760333569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken with no memory of how you arrived, forced to piece together the harrowing experiments and inhumane trials conducted within the facility. As you delve deeper, you discover a malevolent force lurking behind the madness\u2014an entity that warps reality itself. Surviving this ordeal will not only require your wits but also your sanity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152710/extras/80aceec8361f42f9dc08361bedfdfbfa.poster.avif?t=1760333569\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152710/extras/80aceec8361f42f9dc08361bedfdfbfa.webm?t=1760333569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152710/extras/80aceec8361f42f9dc08361bedfdfbfa.mp4?t=1760333569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In HOUSE OF HORROR: OUTSIDE IS BETTER&quot;, every choice matters, and danger lurks behind every corner. With reality and hallucinations blending together, your only hope is to confront the grim truth behind your captivity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152710/extras/e3102952eacdd42bd360abffac020aa7.webp?t=1760333569\" width=121 height=22 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a dynamo flashlight to survive this experience or immerse yourself in it even more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152710/extras/022ff4a60fafdddf7d7df0b597cfec04.poster.avif?t=1760333569\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152710/extras/022ff4a60fafdddf7d7df0b597cfec04.webm?t=1760333569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152710/extras/022ff4a60fafdddf7d7df0b597cfec04.mp4?t=1760333569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152710/extras/afce5a2180638bd4f90c0745679ee374.webp?t=1760333569\" width=111 height=23 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True Survival Horror: You are helpless\u2014without weapons or allies, your only options are to flee, hide, and outsmart your twisted captors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological Terror: Experience a disturbing storyline where sanity erodes with each revelation, blending horror with mental unraveling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Graphics: High-quality visuals plunge players into a grim, claustrophobic environment, heightening the tension at every turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unpredictable Enemies: The psychiatric patients have no pattern\u2014they may stalk you in silence or erupt into violent attacks at any moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Themes: Themes of psychological abuse, torture, and madness play a prominent role, creating an unsettling atmosphere throughout the game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152710/extras/67253a7b283a253df54936559fe22640.webp?t=1760333569\" width=110 height=29 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152710/extras/78a54ef801935c740d3d65a4bfd66910.poster.avif?t=1760333569\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152710/extras/78a54ef801935c740d3d65a4bfd66910.webm?t=1760333569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152710/extras/78a54ef801935c740d3d65a4bfd66910.mp4?t=1760333569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HOUSE OF HORROR: OUTSIDE IS BETTER&quot; contains graphic violence, disturbing imagery, moments of nudity, and intense psychological themes. Viewer discretion is strongly advised. The game also includes scenes that may trigger photosensitivity. Any resemblance to real events or people is purely coincidental.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3152710?t=1760333569","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152710/90945d4b13b087d03452cdd98a736aabd229ed8f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760333569","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152710/8a7b16068d39016722f472bb20a15c07d1b457ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760333569","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152710/8a7b16068d39016722f472bb20a15c07d1b457ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760333569","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"House Of Horror: Outside Is Better thrusts players into a chilling first-person horror adventure, navigating a nightmarish torture facility overrun by psychiatric patients exhibiting dangerously violent behavior. This immersive experience offers a terrifying blend of suspense, horror, and psychological dread, pushing the boundaries of survival in a place where escape seems impossible. Developed by veterans of the horror genre, this game challenges even the most hardened players.\r\n\r\nThe game may contain frequent violence or gore and general adult content."},"demos":[{"appid":3499510,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152710/extras/046eac1a9f68b972a8613a58a6b424df.avif?t=1760333569\" width=1212 height=178 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HOUSE OF HORROR: OUTSIDE IS BETTER&quot; thrusts players into a chilling first-person horror adventure, navigating a nightmarish torture facility overrun by psychiatric patients exhibiting dangerously violent behavior. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This immersive experience offers a terrifying blend of suspense, horror, and psychological dread, pushing the boundaries of survival in a place where escape seems impossible. Developed by veterans of the horror genre, this game challenges even the most hardened players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152710/extras/3740eb47e565aeedf82df7686eccdb8f.webp?t=1760333569\" width=74 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep within a secretive underground facility, unspeakable horrors unfold as psychiatric patients, driven to the edge of madness, become violent and uncontrollable. Once a place of human experimentation and torment, this twisted prison has now become the stage for survival as you, Subject 117, attempt to escape its dark corridors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay mute